WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Isolated debug capture build; data roots and app identity adjusted.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Original test skills prepared before recording. This is the native inventory.

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:13.300
Choose the source skill and Demo Target. No Agent or MCP server is executed.

4
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:20.400
Real diff: current target on the left, source on the right. Not yet synced.

5
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:28.500
The test script edits the target off-screen, then confirms. Stale apply is blocked; hashes verify no overwrite.

6
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:36.000
Preview again: the external edit remains. Explicit replacement approval is required again.

7
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.100
Review the conflict, explicitly approve replacement, then confirm sync.

8
00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:44.000
Sync succeeds. Checks confirm unchanged source, matching target, and a backup of the previous target.

9
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.500
Switch the reader to demo-target to inspect the actual synced content.

10
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:56.633
A brief Settings transition is cut. The actual activity log records success; this is not cross-product runtime certification.

